then using the cp cmd i copied the ssh keyuu to my challenge folder 

then using the command from the challenge i ran it by using the ssh key file name 

but it gave me a permission error 

i was stuck here for sometime thats when i refered to a writeup and saw that using the noraml chmod +x does not work, instead it was chmod 600

the difference is 

chmod +x file — adds execute permission (makes a file runnable). Equivalent to chmod a+x.

chmod 600 file — sets the file to owner read/write only (rw-------) — no execute, no group/other
then when i ran the command (given below) again it conencted me to the server 

